BT /F2 22 Tf 72 740 Td (The Calvin Cycle) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 700 Td (The second stage is called the Calvin cycle, and it does not need light directly. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 682 Td (uses the ATP and NADPH produced earlier to turn carbon dioxide into glucose. Glucose) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 664 Td (is a simple sugar that plants use for energy and growth. Extra glucose is stored as) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 646 Td (starch in roots, stems and seeds. Farmers can improve crop yields by making sure) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 628 Td (plants get enough light, water and carbon dioxide.) Tj ET
endstream
